# A module that is handed a position and a computation: it places molecules beside the
# position, over a range computed from it, and continues its code at the position, wherever it
# is imported.

#> needs: importdir, ctx, expression, constdir, place
.REQUIRE VALUE CORNER
.REQUIRE VALUE WIDTH
.REQUIRE VALUE MARGIN (1|1)
.CONST BEYOND (CORNER + MARGIN)
.PLACE DATA:WIDTH BEYOND
.PLACE STRUCTURE:2 (CORNER[0] + 2)..(CORNER[0] + 4)|CORNER[1]
#<

#> needs: importdir, ctx, expression, org, label, instruction
.ORG CORNER
EXPORT INSIDE:
  NOP
#<
